1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:04,647
Part 15 mein godown ka kaam: approved orders ki pick list,

2
00:00:04,647 --> 00:00:11,517
mobile phone par rack aur batch dekh kar picking, kam maal milne par short pick, packing,

3
00:00:11,517 --> 00:00:13,678
aur packed order ka invoice.

4
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:21,565
Owner ki screen par Pick and pack menu mein badge dikhta hai: kitni pick lists baaki hain.

5
00:00:21,565 --> 00:00:27,856
Yeh queue sabse purane order se shuru hoti hai, taaki koi order peeche na chhoote.

6
00:00:28,548 --> 00:00:33,035
Lekin picking godown ka staff apne phone par karta hai.

7
00:00:33,035 --> 00:00:38,990
Yeh hai Rahul, demo warehouse staff, jo employee ID aur PIN se login hai.

8
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:44,456
Uske phone par sirf Pick and pack jaise godown ke kaam dikhte hain.

9
00:00:47,287 --> 00:00:51,538
Rahul Ramgarh Janta Medical ki pick list kholta hai.

10
00:00:51,538 --> 00:00:57,833
Har line par rack number, product, batch, expiry aur kitne packs uthane hain.

11
00:00:57,833 --> 00:01:05,355
Lines rack ke pick order mein lagi hain, taaki godown mein ek hi chakkar mein sab mil jaaye.

12
00:01:06,104 --> 00:01:07,853
Start picking dabaiye.

13
00:01:07,853 --> 00:01:15,484
Ab order ka status Picking ho gaya, aur office mein sabko dikhta hai ki maal uthaya ja raha hai.

14
00:01:16,174 --> 00:01:23,120
Pehli line: rack number dekha, batch match kiya, packs uthaye, aur Picked all dabaya.

15
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:30,474
Har line ke saath batch number milana zaroori hai, taaki galat batch chemist tak na jaaye.

16
00:01:31,167 --> 00:01:37,904
Agli line par shelf par maal kam nikla, toh Short dabaiye aur jitna mila utna likhiye.

17
00:01:37,904 --> 00:01:42,134
Short pick par invoice sirf uthaye hue maal ka banega,

18
00:01:42,134 --> 00:01:45,659
aur free goods bhi usi anupaat mein ghatenge.

19
00:01:46,399 --> 00:01:48,697
Baaki lines par Picked all.

20
00:01:48,697 --> 00:01:56,270
Saari lines pick hone ke baad, kitne boxes mein pack kiya, woh likhiye, aur Pack dabaiye.

21
00:01:56,270 --> 00:02:01,035
Order packed ho gaya aur ab invoice ke liye taiyaar hai.

22
00:02:01,711 --> 00:02:03,312
Wapas office mein.

23
00:02:03,312 --> 00:02:06,514
Order ab Packed to invoice mein hai.

24
00:02:06,514 --> 00:02:09,716
Order kholkar Raise invoice dabaiye.

25
00:02:09,716 --> 00:02:17,187
Invoice bilkul utne maal ka banta hai jitna pick hua, usi batch aur expiry ke saath.

26
00:02:17,902 --> 00:02:25,369
Picking ki galti distribution mein sabse mehngi galti hoti hai: galat product, galat batch,

27
00:02:25,369 --> 00:02:26,354
ya kam maal.

28
00:02:26,354 --> 00:02:34,067
Rack, batch aur quantity ki line-by-line confirmation se yeh galtiyan kaafi kam ho jaati hain.

29
00:02:34,067 --> 00:02:37,842
Barcode scan se picking abhi uplabdh nahi hai.

30
00:02:39,572 --> 00:02:45,188
Part 16 mein dispatch aur delivery: invoiced orders ko van trip mein jodna,

31
00:02:45,188 --> 00:02:52,003
delivery person assign karna, van nikalna, delivery phone par receiver ka naam aur payment,

32
00:02:52,003 --> 00:02:55,672
na pahunch paaye maal ka kya, aur trip ka hisaab.

33
00:02:56,648 --> 00:02:59,358
Warehouse mein Dispatch kholiye.

34
00:02:59,358 --> 00:03:07,404
Ready to dispatch mein woh saare invoices hain jo ban chuke hain par abhi godown se nikle nahi.

35
00:03:07,404 --> 00:03:12,316
Har invoice ka number, chemist, pata aur value dikhti hai.

36
00:03:14,902 --> 00:03:23,068
Ek route ke invoices chuniye: City Care Chemists, Hinoo Family Pharmacy aur Doranda Drug House.

37
00:03:23,068 --> 00:03:26,850
Teeno Ranchi ke andar ek hi raaste par hain.

38
00:03:27,542 --> 00:03:35,536
Gaadi number, driver ka naam, route, aur delivery person yaani app wala user chuniye:

39
00:03:35,536 --> 00:03:38,733
Manoj, hamara demo delivery staff.

40
00:03:38,733 --> 00:03:40,426
Plan trip dabaiye.

41
00:03:41,097 --> 00:03:44,722
Trip ban gaya, dispatch number ke saath.

42
00:03:44,722 --> 00:03:48,527
Jab van godown se nikle, Van left dabaiye.

43
00:03:48,527 --> 00:03:52,877
Ab in orders ka status Out for delivery ho gaya.

44
00:03:53,557 --> 00:03:55,219
Ab Manoj ka phone.

45
00:03:55,219 --> 00:03:59,651
Usne apne employee ID aur PIN se login kiya hai.

46
00:03:59,651 --> 00:04:06,023
My deliveries mein aaj ka trip hai: har drop ka chemist, pata, value,

47
00:04:06,023 --> 00:04:08,793
aur Call aur Navigate buttons.

48
00:04:14,847 --> 00:04:17,972
City Care Chemists par maal diya.

49
00:04:17,972 --> 00:04:20,245
Record delivery kholiye.

50
00:04:20,245 --> 00:04:22,045
Outcome: Delivered.

51
00:04:22,045 --> 00:04:29,148
Received by mein lene wale ka naam zaroori hai: yahi proof of delivery hai.

52
00:04:29,148 --> 00:04:32,747
Chemist ne UPI se poore paise de diye.

53
00:04:33,479 --> 00:04:38,001
Collected mein rakam aur UPI reference likhiye, aur Save.

54
00:04:38,001 --> 00:04:43,871
Yeh paisa turant receipt ban kar chemist ke khaate mein jama ho jaata hai,

55
00:04:43,871 --> 00:04:46,171
sabse purane bill ke against.

56
00:04:51,494 --> 00:04:58,627
Hinoo Family Pharmacy par maal diya, payment baad mein hogi, toh sirf receiver ka naam.

57
00:04:58,627 --> 00:05:04,121
Doranda Drug House band mila: Outcome Could not deliver aur reason.

58
00:05:04,121 --> 00:05:09,778
Aisa invoice wapas dispatch desk par aa jaata hai, agle trip ke liye.

59
00:05:10,451 --> 00:05:17,837
Office mein dispatch board par trip ka poora hisaab hai: har invoice ka status, kisne liya,

60
00:05:17,837 --> 00:05:19,623
aur kitna collect hua.

61
00:05:19,623 --> 00:05:25,711
Delivery reconciliation ke liye driver se cash aur UPI isi list se milaiye.

62
00:05:26,391 --> 00:05:31,667
Photo ya signature se proof of delivery abhi uplabdh nahi hai.

63
00:05:31,667 --> 00:05:35,241
Proof receiver ke naam se record hota hai.

64
00:05:35,241 --> 00:05:39,155
Yeh limitation hamari QA report mein darj hai.
